opy-wrapper=\"true\"><h1 class=\"heading-line-1\">Dootsie&#x27;s</h1><h1 class=\"heading-line-3\">Story</h1></div></div><div class=\"hero-image\"><img alt=\"About Dootsie&#x27;s\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fabout%2Fabout-hero.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout%2Fabout-hero.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout%2Fabout-hero.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout%2Fabout-hero.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout%2Fabout-hero.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout%2Fabout-hero.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout%2Fabout-hero.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout%2Fabout-hero.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fabout%2Fabout-hero.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></section><section class=\"about-info\"><div class=\"container\"><div data-copy-wrapper=\"true\"><p class=\"mono\">Defined by Balance and Restraint</p><h3>Dootsie&#x27;s is an exercise in quiet composition, where space, light, and material come together with deliberate restraint.</h3><h3>In the same spirit, the menu follows a measured approach, guided by balance, clarity, and precision. Each element is considered, each plate composed to feel complete yet effortless.</h3></div></div></section><section class=\"image-banner\"><div class=\"image-banner-bg\"><img src=\"/about/about-image-banner.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"container\"><div data-copy-wrapper=\"true\"><h4>More</h4><h4>Than</h4><h4>Stay</h4></div><div class=\"image-banner-footer\"><p>Dootsie&#x27;s, every detail is designed to make you feel at home with the elegance of Florence just beyond your door.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"marquee\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"marquee-content\"><h1>Since 1984</h1><h3>Art of Stillness</h3></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\"><div class=\"marquee-track\"><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Enduring Taste</span></div></div></div></section><div class=\"sticky-cards\"><div class=\"sticky-card\"><div class=\"sticky-card-img\"><img src=\"/about/sticky-card-1.jpg\" alt=\"The Craft\"/></div><h3>The Craft</h3><p>Guided by quiet precision, each plate is shaped with intention, allowing technique and creativity to meet in a calm balance.</p></div><div class=\"sticky-card\"><div class=\"sticky-card-img\"><img src=\"/about/sticky-card-2.jpg\" alt=\"The Beginning\"/></div><h3>The Beginning</h3><p>What started as a simple pursuit of honesty in cooking became a space where detail, warmth, and restraint define every moment.</p></div><div class=\"sticky-card\"><div class=\"sticky-card-img\"><img src=\"/about/sticky-card-3.jpg\" alt=\"The Experience\"/></div><h3>The Experience</h3><p>An atmosphere composed of light, texture, and stillness invites every sense to settle in, creating a presence that lingers.</p></div><div class=\"sticky-card\"><div class=\"sticky-card-img\"><img src=\"/about/sticky-card-4.jpg\" alt=\"The Flavors\"/></div><h3>The Flavors</h3><p>Seasonal ingredients are treated with clarity and respect, forming subtle layers that reveal themselves slowly with each bite.</p></div><div class=\"sticky-card\"><div class=\"sticky-card-img\"><img src=\"/about/sticky-card-5.jpg\" alt=\"The Future\"/